Our client is an association.

Jobomschrijving

• Creation of membership invoices and fee collection. Preparation of monthly report for financial matters eg list of invoices for month; summary of expenses; explanation of unusual/unbudgeted cost;
• Automate all regular procedures to maximise efficiency of the Association reviewing role of AI in helpgin achieve this;
• Develop written procedures for all adminstrative processes and communicate these to the team;
• Provide meetings support to the Secretariat such as room booking, catering, hotel booking;
• Ensure lists of local hotels and restaurants are available for members;
• Provide admnistrative support for any EU projects.

You must have experience in finance & administration.You have appetence for NGO sector.You have a professional level in English.
